ESS WIRE)--GILEAD SCIENCES, INC. (NASDAQ: GILD) AND KITE, A GILEAD COMPANY, WILL PRESENT 17 ABSTRACTS FROM ITS INDUSTRY-LEADING CELL THERAPY PORTFOLIO AND GROWING BLOOD CANCER PIPELINE AT THE UPCOMING 2023 EUROPEAN HEMATOLOGY ASSOCIATION (EHA) ANNUAL CONGRESS BEING HELD IN FRANKFURT, GERMANY, JUNE 8-11, AND VIRTUALLY JUNE 14-15. REAL-WORLD EVIDENCE AND MULTI-YEAR FOLLOW-UP OF PIVOTAL STUDIES REINFORCE CONFIDENCE IN CAR T FOUR REAL-WORLD EVIDENCE.'}{'symbol': 'HRL', 'date': '2023-06-01 06:30:00', 'title': 'HORMEL FOODS REPORTS SECOND QUARTER FISCAL 2023 RESULTS', 'text': 'THE COMPANY REAFFIRMS FULL-YEAR NET SALES AND EARNINGS GUIDANCE\xa0 AND ANNOUNCES PROGRESS ON KEY INITIATIVES. \xa0 AUSTIN, MINN.'}{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2023-06-01 17:00:00', 'title': "HII'S MISSION TECHNOLOGIES DIVISION PROMOTES GARRY SCHWARTZ TO CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER AND TODD GENTRY TO PRESIDENT OF ITS C5ISR BUSINESS", 'text': "MCLEAN, VA., JUNE 01, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HII'S (NYSE: HII) MISSION TECHNOLOGIES DIVISION ANNOUNCED THE PROMOTIONS OF GARRY SCHWARTZ TO CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER OF THE DIVISION AND TODD GENTRY TO PRESIDENT OF ITS C5ISR BUSINESS GROUP. SCHWARTZ AND GENTRY BOTH REPORT TO MISSION TECHNOLOGIES PRESIDENT ANDY GREEN."}{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2023-06-01 15:00:00', 'title': "HII'S INGALLS SHIPBUILDING HONORS EMPLOYEES FOR CONTINUOUS SERVICE", 'text': "PASCAGOULA, MISS., JUNE 01, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HII'S (NYSE: HII) INGALLS SHIPBUILDING DIVISION IS HONORING 45 EMPLOYEES WHO IN 2023 ACHIEVE 40 YEARS OF CONTINUOUS SERVICE TO THE COMPANY. HII REFERS TO THIS ELITE GROUP AS “MASTER SHIPBUILDERS,” A DESIGNATION RESERVED FOR INDIVIDUALS WHOSE CONTRIBUTIONS SPAN FOUR DECADES, NEARLY HALF OF INGALLS' 85-YEAR SHIPBUILDING LEGACY."}{'symbol': 'ILMN', 'date': '2023-06-01 14:00:00', 'title': 'ILLUMINA UNVEILS AI SOFTWARE TO PREDICT DISEASE-CAUSING GENETIC MUTATIONS IN PATIENTS', 'text': "PUBLISHED FINDINGS DEMONSTRATE PRIMATEAI-3D'S ABILITY TO IMPROVE GENETIC RISK PREDICTION 